      "review_description": "In November 2020 we used Ben Rudd Electrical & Solar to install our solar system at our home on the South Coast of NSW after a recommendation from our regular electrician.  Ben explained everything in detail making sure that we understood the inverter, panels, size of system for our situation and more importantly the placement of the system to attract the most benefit from the sun.  Ben and his staff arrived on time and conducted themselves in a most professional way and left our site clean and tidy.  My husband and I are both in our 70's so had many questions about the phone application but Ben has been very patient and helpful in getting things sorted for us.  We have no hesitation in recommending Ben Rudd Electrical and Solar for all your solar needs.Bill & Lynn Blomfield",
